        　　First of all, let me tell you the core advantages of this CNC high-pressure cleaning machine - strong flexibility, small size, specifically designed for complex workpiece cavities, which is also its biggest difference from ordinary high-pressure cleaning machines. Many complex workpieces, such as irregular molds and precision parts, have cavities and grooves that ordinary cleaning equipment nozzles cannot penetrate. Even if they can penetrate, they cannot fit the shape of the workpiece for cleaning, leaving cleaning dead corners and even damaging the surface of the workpiece.
        base64_image
