        　　This CNC high-pressure cleaning machine is equipped with a CNC drive device, and the high-pressure spray head can follow the CNC system to accurately fit the shape of the workpiece. It can flexibly complete the entire process of scanning, spraying, water blowing, and deburring, and has particularly strong flexible processing capabilities. Simply put, no matter how complex the shape of the workpiece or how fine the inner cavity is, the spray head can "follow the workpiece" and cover every corner in all directions, without missing stains and burrs, nor damaging the surface of the workpiece. It is especially suitable for cleaning precision workpieces, which is also the precision advantage brought by CNC technology.
        　　可能有朋友會問，柔性強(qiáng)是不是意味著效率低？完全不用擔(dān)心，這款清洗機(jī)的工作效率特別高，尤其是針對形狀復(fù)雜的零件、模具，清洗毛刺的效果更是突出。大家都知道，工件加工后殘留的毛刺，看似不起眼，卻會影響后續(xù)加工精度和產(chǎn)品質(zhì)量，甚至可能導(dǎo)致設(shè)備故障。人工去毛刺，不僅慢，還容易清理不徹底，而這款CNC高壓清洗機(jī)，利用高壓水射流的強(qiáng)大沖擊力，能快速剝離毛刺，清洗、去毛刺一步到位。
